  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Somalia anticipatory action flood pilot</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This anticipatory action aims to mitigate the impact of flooding in four vulnerable districts through  a consortium.  Planned activities (beneficiary targets are total figures, not just Oxfam targets):  (a) Procure and distribute NFIs to 2,100 households  (b) Distribute immediate lifesaving water filter to 2,800 HHs  (c) Insecticide -Treated Free Standing Mosquito Nets (which will benefit 2,014 households  (d) Support Community hygiene promoters reaching 44,000 people  (e) Community engagement in Prevention and Management of Cholera and AWD reaching 24,000 individuals  (f) Mass Disinfection campaign reaching 24,000 individuals.</narrative>
  </description>
